Z||000000||Au nrod||04-06-2001||09:52 AM||||while you all are setting your calendars for car shows this summer, how about checking off June 23 for the C.O.F.E. (Central Ohio Fiero Enthusiasts) show in Wooster, Ohio?<BR>come early and join the Friday nite cruse-in; motels nearby; meet opens @ 7am; judging starts@ 11am; lots of classes; buffet/awards dinner sat.nite; see info on <A HREF="http://www.ohiofiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.ohiofiero.com</A>   -  click on 'events' and go down to June 23||||reg||1
